        {
          "resource_id": "monster_action",
          "stats": {
            "action_name": {
              "value": "Roll the Bones"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "(death, occult)\n\nThe bone croupier targets an adjacent creature that is dying. That creature can either increase its dying value by 1 or roll a d4. On a 4, the creature is no longer dying and is unconscious at 0 HP. On a 1, 2, or 3, however, the creature increases its dying value by that amount. Regardless, the creature is temporarily immune for the next 24 hours."
            },
            "action_type": {
              "value": "none"
